 of the dead, allowing the living to say a proper goodbye. Now, he turns his focus back to studying magic that can revive the dead. He seems to deeply resent the God of Death.","jp":"ホーリンとヤクボルの葬儀はすべて順調に終わった。儀式では、モルガンが死者の魂を呼び出し、残された家族と別れをすることができた。死神に不満を持つモルガンは、このまま死者を蘇らせる魔法を研究するつもりらしい。","kr":"보칼리스와 아쿠보르의 장례가 순조롭게 진행되었다. 제사 의식에서 모르간은 죽은 자들의 영혼을 불러내 산 자들과 작별 인사를 할 수 있게 도왔다. 모르간은 죽음의 신에게 강한 불만을 감추지 않고 계속해서 죽은 자를 살리는 마법을 연구할 것이라고 했다."},"context_summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"context_summary_record_index":25581,"context_summary_record_indices":[25581],"context_summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","context_summary_source_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10031230","context_summary_direction":"previous_plot_summary","context_summary_distance":96,"sequence_index":216,"previous_story_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10049340","next_story_asset_key":"ep5/npcpanel_menu_10047350"},"action_source":{"kind":"MenuWorldActionOption","shard":"","record_order":"315","table_key":"366","record_key":"366","choice_index":"","ID":"366","ObjectID":"1004937","Mode":"","ObjectClientType":"","ShowCondition":"true","OptionStatement":"我带你离开这里","ClickAction":"ed.ActionX.C_StartMiniPlay(\"Doggy\",42)","ReturnMenu":"false","PrefabName":"pbui_dialogue_icon_choose","Priority":"1","Gender":"false","ReddotID":"0","AdditionalPrefabs":"[]","AdditionalLuas":"[]"},"miniplay":{"kind":"MiniPlay","shard":"","record_order":"42","table_key":"7","record_key":"7:42","choice_index":"","PuzzleType":"7","GroupID":"42","BeginID":"[ObjCategory_Doggy | 208]","BugID":"[]","BugValue":"[]","BugParam":"","ExitID":"[]","PathFindingRes":"[doggy_ep5_2]","MapID":"0","RangeID":"16","PuzzleUIID":"144","ScheduleID":"0","HasPrompt":"false","PromptCD":"[]","NeedMatch":"0","HideObjIDs":"[ObjCategory_None | 1002582 | ObjCategory_None | 1002579]","Centroid":"0","DynamicCamName":"","MapRangeParams":"[]","SuccCondition":"true","FailCondit